Description: Add optional versioned Present policy hooks
 Expose Copy, request selection and modifier callbacks to Xorg modules.
 Keep request execution, bounded Copy deferral, fences, notifications and
 resource ownership in the server; retain native behavior without a provider.
Origin: local
Forwarded: no
